Rem ===================================================================
Rem cave-vocab.shoddy -- what you may say to it. Hand-edited source.
Rem First written by a generator from adventure.yaml; both are in
Rem obsolete/ now and neither is run. The C is the reference.
Rem
Rem 76 motion words and 58 action words, each with its synonyms.
Rem Words are matched on their first five letters, so the synonym
Rem lists are already truncated to five in the source data.
Rem Oldstyle is False where the single-letter form is suppressed
Rem under the -o flag. NoAction marks the verbs that only speak.
Rem ===================================================================

Rem The last three are grammar, and they belong on the row rather than in
Rem lists held elsewhere: adding a verb should be one edit, in one place.
Rem BigWord is the FEE FIE FOE FOO sequence. SpeaksTransitively marks the
Rem verbs actions.c gives no transitive handler at all, so naming a thing
Rem after one just speaks its message. NeedsObject marks the verbs with no
Rem intransitive form, which ask "Wave what?" and wait.
Type Vocab
    Tag                 As String
    Words               As List Of String
    Oldstyle            As Boolean
    NoAction            As Boolean
    Message             As String
    BigWord             As Boolean
    SpeaksTransitively  As Boolean
    NeedsObject         As Boolean

